      "id": "claim_dcb56aa802b1414b9b59f6a79017b656",
      "statement": "Concurrent identical uploads produce exactly one content row because the worker uses an insert-or-get on the contents table's unique sha256 index; both learners' documents are linked to that single row.",
      "evidence": [
